{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach and grab it. If heavy, move to location. Then do specific task. Else scan. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedLocation    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
